    "body": "Whether i32 or u32 the status fits in is consistent in one shell, and in supported platform the status code fits in 32bit.\r\nUntil the platform that have larger status code than 32bit will be supported, I think that assuming that the status code fits in 32bit is no problem and hex_status doesn't have to be restricted only for Windows. Similally, I think it doesn't have to apply to int too.\r\nBut I think that the size of status code that the module receives should be documented.",
